  //   TC2  overlapping-span-3-interval-2, gap-span-2-interval-4
  //   TI1  overlapping-span-3-interval-2, gap-span-2-interval-4
  //   C1   span-only-3, max-size-2, overlapping-span-3-interval-2, gap-span-2-interval-4, empty-source
  //   E1   error-mid-stream
